# Copy to .env.local. Every value here is optional -- the app runs without any
# of them, it just runs with fewer capabilities.

# Where the FastAPI backend lives. Unset in dev: vite.config.ts proxies /api.
# VITE_API_BASE=/api

# --- 3D globe -------------------------------------------------------------
# A Cesium Ion token turns on world terrain, so fields sit on real relief.
# Without it the 3D mode still works, on a smooth ellipsoid.
# Free token: https://ion.cesium.com/tokens
# VITE_CESIUM_ION_TOKEN=

# --- assistant ------------------------------------------------------------
# Any OpenAI-compatible /chat/completions endpoint that supports tool calling
# (Ollama, vLLM, llama.cpp server, LM Studio, OpenAI, a proxy in front of
# Claude). Leave VITE_LLM_BASE unset and the assistant falls back to
# deterministic command parsing -- it still performs every action and still
# produces the full analysis, it just will not follow free-form phrasing.
# VITE_LLM_BASE=http://localhost:11434/v1
# VITE_LLM_MODEL=qwen2.5:7b-instruct
# VITE_LLM_KEY=